      "created_at": "2013-08-09T20:55:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I got mine from my printer at work&nbsp; <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_frowning_face.png?v=9\" title=\":slightly_frowning_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_frowning_face:\"></p>\n<p>They are Promo Hero cards. They work with the same hero deck but offer a different base power that can really change how you play the deck.</p>\n<p>You can get the real things by going to conventions and stuff!</p>\n<p>Other than that, you will just have to print proxies from Board Game Geeks.</p>",
